      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "To fully implement this program you should designate one of your top key administrators to oversee the administration of this activity in your agency including the submission of quarterly reports as required under the terms and conditions of the 1956-57 Budget. You should also assign an individual to assist the administrator to coordinate and carry out this program at all levels of operation and to act as liason with the Bureau of the Budget. The Budget Director will contact you to set up a meeting with these key employees to discuss the details of the program with them.",
